//MainActivity
Volume Manager
Volume Manager Setup
Welcome to Volume Manager! Easily control app volumes and more. Get Started
Shizuku Permission Required Shizuku permission is essential for per-app audio control. Without it, the app cannot function. Shizuku Permission For per-app audio control. Grant Shizuku Permission Next Waiting for Shizuku… Please grant Shizuku permission in the app that just opened. Grant All Permissions
Accessibility Service Enable the Accessibility Service to show the volume overlay and interact with app-specific volume controls. Accessibility Service To show the volume overlay. Enable Accessibility Service Skip for now
Notification Access Grant Notification Access to allow VolumeManager to change Ringer Mode & Do Not Disturb settings. Notification Access To change Ringer Mode & DND. Grant Notification Access
Bluetooth Permission Grant Bluetooth permission to enable detection of Bluetooth audio devices for specific volume profiles. Bluetooth Permission To detect Bluetooth devices. Grant Bluetooth Permission Finish
You are All Set! VolumeManager is now ready to use. You can change optional permissions later in settings. Go to App
